<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom bought back off market at NZ$7.23.</title>
<headline>Telecom bought back off market at NZ$7.23.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Thursday it had acquired 34,860 shares on-market on Wednesday at NZ$7.23 each, pursuant to its NZ$1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>The current phase of Telecom's buyback is expected to continue until the company gives notice that it is completed.</p>
<p>Telecom's shares are currently trading at $7.38.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
